<BRK/>
[<ITM><SUB>Mock-up Installation of EIFS</SUB>; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]<LST><SUB>SD-05 Design Data</SUB></LST><BRK/>
<BRK/>
